<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal rejects bids at six-month bill sale.</title>
<headline>Portugal rejects bids at six-month bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Institute for Public Credit Management rejected all bids at its offer to sell 10 billion escudos of six-month bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The average yield was 5.51 percent at the last such sale on July 7.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
